## Optional semantic model weights

The optional `semantic-candle` feature can load
`intfloat/multilingual-e5-small` model weights, pinned to revision
`614241f622f53c4eeff9890bdc4f31cfecc418b3`:

- Model weights license: MIT (intfloat/multilingual-e5-small)
- Model card: https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small
- Technical report: https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.05672

Weights are never bundled in the default binary and never downloaded by the
tool itself; operators import a verified local bundle with
`asg model import --dir <bundle>` (see `docs/operations/SEMANTIC-MODEL-BUNDLE.md`).

